cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this software release."
type: software
title: "Molecular HOMA-IR modeling and treatment-effect decomposition"
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Cao"
    given-names: "Zehui"
    affiliation: "Fudan University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6105-3104"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zehhhui/molecular-homa-ir"
abstract: >-
  Repeated nested elastic-net modeling of molecular HOMA-IR from metabolomics
  and proteomics, training-only cross-fitted score integration, frozen week-24
  prediction, and decomposition of randomized chiglitazar-control differences
  into molecular contributions. The code corresponds to the 705-person baseline
  and 593-person paired follow-up analysis. Synthetic examples and aggregate
  validation targets are provided; individual clinical data and trained study
  models are not distributed.
keywords:
  - insulin resistance
  - HOMA-IR
  - multi-omics
  - elastic net
  - chiglitazar
  - reproducible research
